## Type additions

# add new types to search by
--type-add
gradle:*.{gradle,gradle.kts}

--type-add
tf:*.{tf,tfvars}

# ignore case
--smart-case

# Markdown (and MDX)
--type-add
md:*.{md,mdx}

# follow symlinks
--follow

# include hidden files
--hidden

# Don't go into the .git/ directory
--glob=!.git/*
